  "notes": "レンチン is a casual compound word formed from レンジ (microwave oven) + チン (the ding sound a microwave makes when done). It is used as both a noun and a suru verb.\n\nFORMS:\nレンジ (microwave) + チン (ding sound) → レンチン\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- レンチンする: to microwave\n- レンチンするだけ: just microwave it\n- レンチン{料理|りょうり}: microwave cooking\n\nUSAGE:\nThis word is casual and commonly used in everyday conversation and on social media. In more formal contexts, {電子|でんし}レンジで{温|あたた}める is preferred.",
